0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T16:21:01-08:00","id":1004695,"title":"","content":"It doesn't.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T16:47:47-08:00","id":1004706,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1000344-beast-and-lunars?p=1004551#post1004551\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Glob, why don't you ever answer me?!</div> </div> </div> </div><i>Glob is dead.</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T17:03:01-08:00","id":1004709,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>semicasual</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1000344-beast-and-lunars?p=1004693#post1004693\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ah yes, my favorite YMMV trope. Where the line between what is zany and what is intolerable? Nobody agrees.<br /> <br /> And what is does over-the-top punishing behavior have to do with LGBTQ-ness? To be honest, until I read this thread, I had no idea Beast used that as a base.</div> </div> </div> </div>It doesn't. There are queer characters in the book who are Beasts.<br /> <br /> At this point I think it's worth noting that a feeling of alienation from others that Beasts experience as described in the books is not entirely unlike the feeling of being a marginalized person, (It sounded right to me as a queer black male) but I think people take that point of reference and stretch it out over the rest of the game to a really wild degree that doesn't feel called for.<br /> <br /> That they find individual things like the example character abhorrent just sort of gets thrown into the mix.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-17T20:19:54-08:00","id":1004780,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>semicasual</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1000344-beast-and-lunars?p=1004693#post1004693\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To be honest, until I read this thread, I had no idea Beast used that as a base.</div> </div> </div> </div>Same tbh. Now I'm... perplexed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\">Bearer of the legacy of Trauma Bear<br /> Need a dice-roller? Check out <a href=\"http://bit.ly/dicemat\" target=\"_blank\">Dicemat</a>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/43-fata-ku","name":"Fata-Ku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar43_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2240"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-18T00:30:40-08:00","id":1004829,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1000344-beast-and-lunars?p=1004648#post1004648\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Because you're a M:tAs fan.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wrong.<br /> <br /> I am a Technocracy fan. :P<br /> <br /> I think most of Mage is so incoherent that it makes little to no sense, and my Mage is so houseruled that half the existing Traditions don't <i>exist</i>.<br /> <br /> I mean, I don't like Werewolf: The Apocalypse, but at least it's fucking coherent about what you are supposed to do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;There is a remedy for everything but death, a hope for everything but wickedness, and everything will lapse except righteousness.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6042-manusdomine","name":"ManusDomine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6042_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-21T12:11:38-08:00","id":1006322,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>semicasual</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1000344-beast-and-lunars?p=1004693#post1004693\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ah yes, my favorite YMMV trope. Where the line between what is zany and what is intolerable? Nobody agrees.<br /> <br /> And what is does over-the-top punishing behavior have to do with LGBTQ-ness? To be honest, until I read this thread, I had no idea Beast used that as a base.</div> </div> </div> </div>Punishing behavior has nothing to do with LGBTQ-ness and Beast didn't use LGBTQ as a base strictly. <br /> <br /> The original draft struck a chord with me though with the Homecoming, where a Beast has always felt different and off from other people around them, growing up with reoccurring nightmares. Until when they decide to face the thing stalking them in their nightmare, they realize that the monster is actually them and their awareness of what they are and how it separates them from others dawns on them. <br /> <br /> There's a feeling of isolation, being different without knowing why and then upon learning what you are, how its something that is often demonized and outcast. That really felt evocative of my own coming out experience.<br /> <br /> There are a couple other aspects that resonated with me, but they're pretty controversial and would prefer not getting deeper than this for this thread. <br /> <br /> The developer has said they didnt intend for this kind of interpretation and in the final draft, the Homecoming largely got left out and replaced with the Devouring which... Well, comes across as a vampire Embrace knockoff to me and a lot less evocative. <br /> <br /> Ah well... *shrugs*","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/851-paradim","name":"Paradim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar851_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}